59
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:41,860
To not give up on the one you love.

60
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:43,740
But I can't do that.

61
00:04:44,100 --> 00:04:47,140
And now, I can't stop crying.

62
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:16,720
