Well, I'd never leave you like that.

92
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:28,660
I'd stay with you always, in
here and in the real world.

93
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:34,040
I, I, uh, Leafa, I mean,
Tsuguha, I love you!

94
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,140
You what?

95
