224
00:19:12,953 --> 00:19:13,783
Aaaaah!

225
00:19:17,140 --> 00:19:18,540
Aaaaaah!

226
00:19:24,460 --> 00:19:25,860
Aaaaah!

227
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:35,820
You can do it!

228
00:19:36,740 --> 00:19:37,820
Go, Kazuto!

229
00:19:38,940 --> 00:19:40,020
Go!

230
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:01,500
