232
00:20:09,620 --> 00:20:11,460
Keep going. Fly!

233
00:20:12,760 --> 00:20:15,020
Keep flying as long as you can!

234
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:20,220
To the very end!

235
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:28,920
Damn it.

236
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,380
